\":\"functionality\",\"title\":\"AI-Powered Tab Content Synthesis\",\"description\":\"Transform tabs from passive displays into active intelligence engines. Each tab would have an AI layer that synthesizes its content into actionable insights. The Overview tab becomes a live executive summary that updates in real-time as the user explores other tabs. Findings tab provides auto-clustering by topic, entity, or controversy. Sources tab shows credibility networks and bias detection. The system learns from user interactions to prioritize what matters most.\",\"reasoning\":\"Users currently navigate between static data views. An AI-powered synthesis layer would transform tabs into active research assistants, automatically surfacing the most relevant information and relationships. This turns the tab interface from information display into intelligence augmentation.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:07:25.540Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:07:25.540Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:07:29.916Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01PfNgTTNNJ8h5FWF6WS7Hfs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DGqSZyCCrFZFTaMWma5HUY","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/ideas -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"scan_id\\\": \\\"77bbbdcb-5a6f-414a-b139-376e32a219d3\\\", \\\"project_id\\\": \\\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\\\", \\\"context_id\\\": \\\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\\\", \\\"scan_type\\\": \\\"moonshot_architect\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"functionality\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Cross-Tab Semantic Relationship Graph\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Build a unified knowledge graph that spans all tab content. When viewing any entity in EntitiesTab, users see connected findings, relevant sources, and related perspectives in a floating panel. Click a finding and see the causal chains it participates in, sources that support/contradict it, and entities mentioned. This creates a true hyperlinked research environment where every piece of information is connected to its context across all data dimensions.\\\", \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Currently tabs operate as isolated data silos. A semantic relationship graph would reveal the hidden connections between entities, sources, findings, and perspectives that are impossible to see in tabular views. This creates the kind of interconnected research experience that defines world-class intelligence tools.\\\", \\\"effort\\\": 8, \\\"impact\\\": 9, \\\"risk\\\": 6}\"","description":"Create idea 2: Cross-Tab Semantic Relationship Graph"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":458,"cache_read_input_tokens":55607,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":458},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2