\",\"category\":\"functionality\",\"title\":\"Cross-Tab Semantic Relationship Graph\",\"description\":\"Build a unified knowledge graph that spans all tab content. When viewing any entity in EntitiesTab, users see connected findings, relevant sources, and related perspectives in a floating panel. Click a finding and see the causal chains it participates in, sources that support/contradict it, and entities mentioned. This creates a true hyperlinked research environment where every piece of information is connected to its context across all data dimensions.\",\"reasoning\":\"Currently tabs operate as isolated data silos. A semantic relationship graph would reveal the hidden connections between entities, sources, findings, and perspectives that are impossible to see in tabular views. This creates the kind of interconnected research experience that defines world-class intelligence tools.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:07:30.866Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:07:30.866Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:07:35.539Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01PfNgTTNNJ8h5FWF6WS7Hfs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JkfVu5iHeZ3pcZzqQTGEdT","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/ideas -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"scan_id\\\": \\\"77bbbdcb-5a6f-414a-b139-376e32a219d3\\\", \\\"project_id\\\": \\\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\\\", \\\"context_id\\\": \\\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\\\", \\\"scan_type\\\": \\\"moonshot_architect\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"user_benefit\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Dynamic Tab Composition Engine\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Let users create custom tabs that combine and filter content across all data types. A researcher interested in financial risk could create a tab that shows only high-priority gaps, contradictions related to money, entities with financial roles, and sources with credibility concerns. These custom compositions can be saved, shared as templates, and evolve into community-curated research lenses for specific use cases like due diligence, competitive intel, or investigative journalism.\\\", \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Fixed tabs force users into predetermined workflows. A composition engine would let each user build their optimal research view based on their specific needs. Shared templates would create a community-driven library of research lenses, making the platform increasingly valuable as more users contribute.\\\", \\\"effort\\\": 8, \\\"impact\\\": 9, \\\"risk\\\": 5}\"","description":"Create idea 3: Dynamic Tab Composition Engine"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":458,"cache_read_input_tokens":55607,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":458},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"eaf69611-3724-4ff8-8322-9d839e00e31f"}
