chitect\",\"category\":\"user_benefit\",\"title\":\"Dynamic Tab Composition Engine\",\"description\":\"Let users create custom tabs that combine and filter content across all data types. A researcher interested in financial risk could create a tab that shows only high-priority gaps, contradictions related to money, entities with financial roles, and sources with credibility concerns. These custom compositions can be saved, shared as templates, and evolve into community-curated research lenses for specific use cases like due diligence, competitive intel, or investigative journalism.\",\"reasoning\":\"Fixed tabs force users into predetermined workflows. A composition engine would let each user build their optimal research view based on their specific needs. Shared templates would create a community-driven library of research lenses, making the platform increasingly valuable as more users contribute.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:07:36.483Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:07:36.483Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:07:41.069Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01PfNgTTNNJ8h5FWF6WS7Hfs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EBgbVyevkRjqqVahytaQEn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/ideas -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"scan_id\\\": \\\"77bbbdcb-5a6f-414a-b139-376e32a219d3\\\", \\\"project_id\\\": \\\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\\\", \\\"context_id\\\": \\\"ctx_1769727792597_5tyykyx\\\", \\\"scan_type\\\": \\\"moonshot_architect\\\", \\\"category\\\": \\\"functionality\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Temporal Intelligence Navigator\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Transform the Analysis tab into a time-travel interface for research evolution. Visualize how findings, confidence scores, and entity relationships changed over the research timeline. Show when contradictions emerged and were resolved. Enable 'what-if' time projections that predict how current trends might evolve. Track the provenance of every insight back through the research chain that produced it. This creates a complete temporal audit trail for research intelligence.\\\", \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Research is inherently temporal, but current tabs show only the final state. A temporal navigator would reveal the research journey - when insights emerged, how confidence evolved, what triggered contradictions. This temporal dimension is essential for audit trails, methodology validation, and understanding the reliability of conclusions.\\\", \\\"effort\\\": 9, \\\"impact\\\": 8, \\\"risk\\\": 6}\"","description":"Create idea 4: Temporal Intelligence Navigator"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":458,"cache_read_input_tokens":55607,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":458},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id"